{"id":"c38d15bb3c121301","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-model-general.md","title":"固定基础结构的全部经典真理扩张","display":"df-truth-model-general — 固定基础结构的全部经典真理扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-model-general","aliases":["91-df-truth-model-general","91-df-general-truth-model"],"display":"df-truth-model-general — 固定基础结构的全部经典真理扩张","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-expansion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-model-general"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-model-general</span><span>91-df-general-truth-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-model-general — 固定基础结构的全部经典真理扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f5043d4200f56d1\" href=\"?note=7f5043d4200f56d1\" title=\"91-df-truth-expansion\">91-df-truth-expansion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为新一元关系符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\)</span> 为下述扩张类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}model\\text{-}general}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T):\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}model\\text{-}general}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T):\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\longmapsto\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\quad\\text{是}\\quad\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak M_0|)\\cong\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\quad\\text{的双射},\n\\qquad\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\models T(t)\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\in\\Gamma\\quad(t\\text{闭项}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\longmapsto\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\quad\\text{是}\\quad\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak M_0|)\\cong\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\quad\\text{的双射},\n\\qquad\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\models T(t)\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\in\\Gamma\\quad(t\\text{闭项}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是经典语言扩张类，尚不保证某种真理理论公理。TB/UTB 的模型条件包括完整 PA_T 归纳，旧表只列双条件遗漏了这一项。\n在标准自然数结构，所给 J 的固定点产生 KF 经典闭包；任意非标准结构的外延不能直接使用同一个外部代码跳跃并声称得到 KF 模型。\n单个外延不是部分三值解释的两个外延。外延包含也不意味着初等嵌入或所有含 T 公式的真值单调；含负 T 出现的公式会反转包含方向。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.6 及结构扩张约定，印刷页 69，PDF 页 80；Theorem 15.15。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-expansion","status":"resolved",